Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: sqlcipher3
Upstream-Contact: Charles Leifer <coleifer@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/coleifer/sqlcipher3
Comment: Built from the manylinux wheels on PyPI. The extension module has SQLCipher
 4.19.0 (community edition, which contains SQLite) and OpenSSL 3.6.0 linked in
 statically; neither comes from Debian, nor do their security updates.

